WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.489
Start and controls
Take a seat and press Ready. The host starts when everyone is ready. Your cards or dice are at the bottom.

00:00:12.489 --> 00:00:18.788
Follow the turn prompt. Wait for animations to finish; an expired turn is played automatically. Use Return to room after settlement.

00:00:18.788 --> 00:00:34.788
Crazy Eights: lowest score over three hands
Follow Demo W with action cards enabled. Emptying a hand avoids leftover-card penalties; compare cumulative scores after three hands.

00:00:34.788 --> 00:00:45.788
Match suit or rank
Click a playable card to send it. Check the top discard, active suit, and turn direction in the center.

00:00:45.788 --> 00:00:54.787
Ordinary cards must match suit or rank. Eights are wild; unrelated ordinary cards cannot be played.

00:00:54.787 --> 00:01:05.787
Draw one when you cannot play
Press Draw or click the center stock when blocked. A playable draw may be played or passed; an unplayable draw ends the turn automatically.

00:01:05.787 --> 00:01:14.788
You must play if your hand already has a legal card. Draw at most one card per turn.

00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:26.888
This match uses action cards
Watch visible plays skip a player or change direction, then follow the updated turn order.

00:01:26.888 --> 00:01:36.788
With action cards enabled, Q skips, A reverses, and 2 makes the next player draw two and skip. Emptying a hand cancels the final card’s effect.

00:01:36.788 --> 00:01:47.788
Choose a suit after selecting an eight
Click your eight, then a suit button to commit the declaration. Cancel lets you change cards. Future players follow that active suit.

00:01:47.788 --> 00:01:56.788
A final eight empties the hand immediately without needing a suit declaration.

00:01:56.788 --> 00:02:06.688
A playable draw keeps a choice open
Watch whether the same player still has the turn after drawing. A newly drawn card belongs only to that player until it is played.

00:02:06.688 --> 00:02:14.788
An empty stock refills from discards except the top one. With no playable or drawable cards, a direct pass is allowed.

00:02:14.788 --> 00:02:27.988
Finish hand one and deal again
Speed through the first hand and watch penalties carry into the next fresh deal. The player who empties their hand scores zero for it.

00:02:27.988 --> 00:02:38.787
Leftover eights score 50 each; J, Q, K score 10; A scores 1; other ranks score face value.

00:02:38.787 --> 00:03:10.788
Speed through hands two and three
All remaining actions and fresh deals play in order at higher speed. The match compares all three hands, not just the last winner.

00:03:10.788 --> 00:03:29.800
Crazy Eights: three-hand totals
Demo N wins with 13 points. Demo S has 36, W has 39, and E has 76.
